ther than a doctrine violation. The repository-tree denylist still runs on every pull request.\n\nEdit the `paths` filter in `policy/templates/pack-audit.yml`, not `.github/workflows/pack-audit.yml`. The workflow header says it is instantiated from the template, and the repository doctrine routes workflow edits through the template. Then re-instantiate the workflow from the template.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Proposed trigger additions for policy/templates/pack-audit.yml</summary>\n\n```diff\n       - package.json\n       - pnpm-lock.yaml\n+      - pnpm-workspace.yaml\n+      - .pnpmfile.js\n+      - .pnpmfile.cjs\n+      - .pnpmfile.mjs\n       - 'policy/**'\n```\n</details>","id":"b0738dc3774fc41e68c889caf5a55d431831767177cd87796910a001387e4750","intervals":[],"path":".github/workflows/pack-audit.yml","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Add pnpm install inputs to the pack-audit trigger in the template."}],"head":"482e9f55a55eacc27bdc6f31dc53fb8e53dd6118","head_tree":"caf2bd1c0f6a76b490442f34307539ee3268e814","input_scope":[{"blob":"5d26e0aeff43fe925fb375496a61d6068615cd82","intervals":[[3,3],[5,5],[7,11],[13,13],[15,17],[19,21]],"path":".github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md"},{"blob":"436693d23602a5c9fad0ebdb7d0d777f1808697a","intervals":[[2,2],[10,10],[15,20],[68,72],[77,77],[79,79],[85,85]],"path":".github/workflows/cq-measure.yml"},{"blob":"9316d1f842cccf91029f707d293e28edd002f412","intervals":[[1,1],[5,5],[19,27],[29,35],[40,49],[55,55],[63,68],[76,76],[79,81],[86,86],[88,88],[90,90],[98,98],[131,160],[193,193]],"path":".github/workflows/pack-audit.yml"},{"blob":"83f8bd4f9ada8ccc2db9c2c65de0b8e5ffd9f70e","intervals":[[12,12],[15,15],[35,40],[88,92],[97,97],[100,101],[105,105]],"path":".github/workflows/ratchet-propose-measure.yml"},{"blob":"500b27990756d547519b56db3f929e2e228662bb","intervals":[[2,17],[21,41],[43,44],[46,63],[74,77],[81,81],[86,86],[88,88],[111,116],[138,140],[145,145],[147,147],[149,149],[158,158],[181,181],[185,189],[19